# Question 1
Create a scatter plot comparing **`Age`** vs **`BMI`** from the provided dataset, customize it with specific visual elements, and save it in different formats:
* Add a title, axis labels, and a grid with dashed lines
* Make points semi-transparent blue (alpha=0.5)
* Save the plot in both PNG format (300 dpi) and PDF format, with tight bounding box
    
    <span style="color:#8b0153;">Hint</span>: Use `plt.savefig()` with appropriate parameters for each format

